                                "sense_id": "cfa64101-e85d-3b1e-85f5-4693a9257df8",
                                "text": "“There are over 150 channels dedicated to Kensington and all the things that take place here,” said Sarah Laurel, founder of Savage Sisters, a non-profit in Kensington supporting those affected by substance disorders."
